mbuffer
------------------------------------------
Measuring Buffer is an enhanced version of buffer. It features display of
throughput, memory-mapped file I/O for huge buffers, and multithreading.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libssl3-3.5.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  http://www.maier-komor.de/mbuffer.html

Canonical download:
  http://www.maier-komor.de/software/mbuffer/mbuffer-20261015.tgz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack mbuffer-20261015-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./mbuffer-20261015-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/mbuffer-20261015-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/mbuffer-20261015-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(mbuffer)
  /etc/mbuffer.rc
  /usr/bin/mbuffer.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/mbuffer.README
  /usr/share/doc/mbuffer/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/mbuffer/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/mbuffer/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/mbuffer/NEWS
  /usr/share/doc/mbuffer/README
  /usr/share/man/man1/mbuffer.1.gz

